   "block": "birthday_party.dlg4",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_05",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Of course. That's completely okay. Some people prefer something quiet. What would make the day feel good to you?",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.31,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Honestly, a good meal and a day off with no phone.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.92,
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg4",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That sounds wonderful. You could plan a day trip somewhere new and finish with dinner at your favorite place.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.77,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My family will be upset if I don't celebrate",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 2.22,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "at least a little.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.19,
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg4",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Maybe a small family dinner the weekend after. That way they get to celebrate you, and you still get your quiet day.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg4"
  },
  {
